Subject: [R-pkg-team] Bug#1022821: ITP: r-cran-sftime -- GNU R support for
 simple feature objects that have a time column
Message-ID: <166679122616.1694292.11585461765107701543.reportbug@energija.fam-tille.de>

Package: wnpp
Severity: wishlist

Subject: ITP: r-cran-sftime -- GNU R support for simple feature objects that have a time column
Package: wnpp
Owner: Andreas Tille <tille at debian.org>
Severity: wishlist

* Package name    : r-cran-sftime
  Version         : 0.2
  Upstream Author : Henning Teickner
* URL             : https://cran.r-project.org/package=sftime
* License         : Apache-2.0
  Programming Lang: GNU R
  Description     : GNU R support for simple feature objects that have a time column
 Classes and methods for spatial objects that have a registered time
 column, in particular for irregular spatiotemporal data. The time column can
 be of any type, but needs to be ordinal. Regularly laid out spatiotemporal
 data (vector or raster data cubes) are handled by package 'stars'.

Remark: This package is maintained by Debian R Packages Maintainers at
   https://salsa.debian.org/r-pkg-team/r-cran-sftime


